      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path (28%):</strong> F9 resolves NO (IRGC holds after Sep 1 salvo), conflict freezes at current Hormuz-closed/IAEA-blocked equilibrium through Oct 15 with neither side making concessions.</p>
